{{!
    @template block_coursecare/overview_details

    The detailed information of the "Your course in numbers" page (Features 002, 003, 005 and 006), unchanged in
    content: where the files are and the large files side by side on wide screens, how the files changed, the
    materials by activity, the potential of the assignments and the technical details. Shown in the "Details"
    area (Feature 008) or, without the tabs, after the suggestions. Sections without data are left out.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hascategories, categories - see block_coursecare/overview_categories
    * hashistory, history - see block_coursecare/overview_history
    * hasactivities, activities - see block_coursecare/overview_activities
    * haslarge, large - see block_coursecare/overview_large
    * haspotential, potential - see block_coursecare/overview_potential
    * hastechnical, technical - see block_coursecare/overview_technical

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hascategories": false,
        "hashistory": false,
        "hasactivities": false,
        "haslarge": false,
        "haspotential": false,
        "hastechnical": false
    }
}}
{{#hascategories}}
<div class="block_coursecare-overview-grid">
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_categories }}
    {{#haslarge}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_large }}
    {{/haslarge}}
</div>
{{/hascategories}}
{{#hashistory}}
{{> block_coursecare/overview_history }}
{{/hashistory}}
{{#hasactivities}}
{{> block_coursecare/overview_activities }}
{{/hasactivities}}
{{#haspotential}}
{{> block_coursecare/overview_potential }}
{{/haspotential}}
{{#hastechnical}}
{{> block_coursecare/overview_technical }}
{{/hastechnical}}
